+     * Opt the whole site into animating to/from intrinsic sizing keywords
+     * (e.g. block-size: 0 <-> auto) for simple toggles.
+     *
+     * NOTE: transitioning directly between two *different* intrinsic keyword
+     * sizes (e.g. auto -> max-content, or min-content -> fit-content) is NOT
+     * supported, even with interpolate-size. Only transitions between an
+     * intrinsic keyword and a fixed <length-percentage> (or a calc-size()
+     * expression based on the same keyword) can be interpolated.
+     */
     :root {
+      interpolate-size: allow-keywords;
